# Agent-only exclusions: invisible to git, honoured by ripgrep/fd.
# Rationale: these files are ~60k tokens of prose+lockfile that an agent almost
# never needs to grep, but that pollute every `rg -l` orientation pass.
# Override on demand with `rg --no-ignore` / `rg -u`.
Cargo.lock
SOTA.md
PROGRESS.md
target/
